              "short": "$x=\\dfrac{25}{2}=12\\dfrac12$",
              "worked": "$a=\\frac15$, $b=-\\frac12$, $c=2$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}x&=\\frac{2-(-1/2)}{1/5}\\\\x&=\\frac52\\times5\\\\x&=\\frac{25}{2}\\\\x&=12\\frac12\\end{align*}$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 40
